    "detailed_description": "LIMINAL is a challenging first-person psychological horror. Explore endless procedural environments and discover their meaning. Find ways to survive and make sense of the world around you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2160760/extras/2bcdc6b559e4b34a08aa305964eb3733.webp?t=1714742007\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>World Generation:</strong> Every aspect of the world is procedurally generated. Every playthrough will be unique and leave you with more questions than answers.<br></li><li><strong>Survival:</strong> Food and water are necessary to survive. Fatigue and health must also be managed in order to remain alive.<br></li><li><strong>Entities:</strong> You are not alone. It is within your best interest to avoid any and all entities if you wish to guarantee your survival.<br></li><li><strong>Immersion:</strong> There is no traditional UI. All interfaces within the game are represented on physical objects. This adds another level of immersion to the experience.<br><br></li></ul>",
